name hep-float
category Package
revision 61169
shortdesc Convenience package for float placement
longdesc The hep-float package redefines some LaTeX float placement
longdesc defaults and defines convenience wrappers for floats. The
longdesc package is loaded with \usepackage{hep-float}.
